{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real Car Parking Simulator</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the driver\u2019s seat and test your precision! Real Car Parking Simulator focuses on what matters most \u2013 realistic physics, tricky maneuvers, and levels designed to challenge your parking skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udd7f\ufe0f True-to-life physics \u2013 every turn and brake requires control and focus.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude97 Different types of cars \u2013 from small city rides to larger models that demand extra attention.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf06 Challenging parking spots \u2013 prove your skills in varied scenarios.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Adjustable camera view \u2013 rotate to find the best angle when space gets tight.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 Progressive levels \u2013 each stage gets harder, pushing you to master parking like a pro.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It\u2019s not about racing \u2013 it\u2019s about precision. Show that you\u2019ve got the focus, patience, and skill to become a true parking master!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4066650?t=1760123072","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/9e04e40c75719b6a66ba63a893ce9b9b31c45430/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760123072","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/54af0362a44f224138803db42416ec41d7015abb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760123072","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4066650/54af0362a44f224138803db42416ec41d7015abb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760123072","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achiev